      "text": "## The Dividend Mechanism"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md#002",
      "path": [
        "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
