        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Demographic Dividend",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "DIVIDEND 3 (Quality effect — human capital):\n    With fewer children per woman:\n    → Parents invest MORE per child (quantity-quality tradeoff)\n    → Education attainment rises\n    → Health investment per child rises\n    → Labor quality improves\n    → Productivity growth beyond simple quantity effects"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md#010",
      "path": [
        "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
