        "section": "demography",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Demographic Dividend",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TOTAL ESTIMATED CONTRIBUTION (developing countries):\n  Demographic dividend can contribute 0.5-2.0% additional GDP growth per year\n  over 30-50 year window. Magnitude depends on policy environment.\n```"
    },
