      "text": "DEMOGRAPHIC TIMELINE:\n  1950-1965: Post-war baby boom → young, dependent age structure\n  1965-1975: Rapid fertility decline begins (mortality declined first)\n  1970-2000: Large working-age cohort present + declining youth burden\n             = window of maximum demographic dividend\n  2000-2020: Dividend ending; aging commences; savings rate declining"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md#014",
