      "text": "QUANTITATIVE EVIDENCE:\n  South Korea:\n    TFR: 6.0 (1960) → 2.1 (1983) → 0.72 (2023)\n    GDP per capita (1960): $1,200 (PPP 2011$)\n    GDP per capita (2023): $52,000 (PPP 2023$) — 40× increase in 60 years"
    },
