      },
      "text": "```\nSUB-SAHARAN AFRICA DEMOGRAPHIC STATUS (2023):\n  TFR: ~4.5 (declining from ~6.5 in 1980)\n  OADR: ~6 (lowest in world — tiny elderly population)\n  YDR: ~80 (huge youth cohort)\n  Working-age share of population: ~55% (will rise toward 65%+ as dividend matures)"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md#020",
      "path": [
        "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
