        "title": "Demographic Dividend",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "POTENTIAL WINDOW:\n  If fertility declines at East Asian pace (1970s-80s decline):\n  Working-age bulge would arrive: ~2030-2060\n  Dividend window: ~2040-2070 (30-year opportunity)\n  Additional GDP growth potential: ~1-2% per year above baseline"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md#021",
      "path": [
