      "text": "PREREQUISITES FOR THE DIVIDEND:\n  The dividend is NOT automatic. It requires:"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md#023",
      "path": [
        "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:demography:09-demographic-dividend, git-history:demography:09-demographic-dividend]",
