        "title": "Demographic Dividend",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. FERTILITY DECLINE: Transition must happen to create the favorable structure\n     → Requires: women's education, healthcare access, contraceptive availability,\n       changed family norms → not automatic without investment"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md#024",
      "path": [
        "09-DEMOGRAPHIC-DIVIDEND.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
