        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Demographic Dividend",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. EMPLOYMENT CREATION: Working-age population boom must have JOBS\n     → Requires: investment climate, manufacturing development, SME growth\n     → If jobs don't exist: \"demographic disaster\" rather than dividend\n     → Youth bulge unemployment → political instability\n       (correlation between young male unemployment + conflict well-documented)"
    },
