      "text": "CURRENT STATUS:\n  Africa is racing against its own population growth.\n  Some countries ARE making the investments: Rwanda, Ethiopia, Ghana, Kenya\n  Many are not: DRC, Central African Republic, Niger, Chad\n  Political instability, governance failures, and resource dependence\n  are the primary barriers to capturing the dividend\n```"
